: ""}, "body": "こんにちは、擬人化されたハンサムなグレーのオスのウサギを描いてほしいです。彼は痩せていますが、そこそこの体格で、微妙な金属のアクセントがある革のジャケットを着ていて、下には白いVネックのトップスを着ています。彼はこのポーズをとりながら、見る人も見ています：\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ULLwjYF6O34FHj950ftyPmRu8c5qI48P", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ko8kyo/works/108", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2344035, "client_id": 2486459, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e35060c5/uploads/origins/f0604307-6b92-4263-84a3-f1cf2cae7484?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6ac285d4e3b0d4f02d023dd35ff25f6d", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e35060c5/uploads/origins/f0604307-6b92-4263-84a3-f1cf2cae7484?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=92e6766200199464ded0f4b4b88b8cd5", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！私はあなたのモノクロームのアートスタイルが大好きです！\n\n僕のOCを二人一緒に描いてほしいんだ。悪役夫婦です。\n\n女性はモネ。サディスティックな悪女で、腕はバイオニック、耳は翼。\n- 38歳、大人っぽい。\n- 168センチ。\n- 顔の刺青と目のダイヤモンドの瞳孔は、私にとって非常に重要なディテールである。\n- 舌が長い。\n- 砂時計のような体型で、バスト、ヒップ、太ももが強調されている。\nさらに、この服を着たモネを描いてください： https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/11MnFuYPG3dNnuUJe8FQbN2GLFpNhVOeK?usp=sharing\n\n男はレスター。ハーピーでモネのヤンデレ夫。\n- 41歳。大人っぽい。\n- 181cm\n- 腕を覆う翼がポイント\n\n二人が抱き合い、牙を剥き出しにした邪悪な笑みを浮かべて、殺意をもって見る者を見つめる姿を描いてください。モネが長い舌を出しているのも描いてください！\n\nご検討ありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1NHrlYjkuuEjZazbmSgsZm5zf1qiTvUOK?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ko8kyo/works/107", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2344035, "client_id": 1790974, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1c1437fe/uploads/origins/861802fa-bc79-436f-81be-7cca77d2140a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e759572465a6f82c178140b3f83ad969", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1c1437fe/uploads/origins/861802fa-bc79-436f-81be-7cca77d2140a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f496f340cf9c8d7b6a93e7f3294fdc45", "src_set": ""}, "body": "これは私のキャラクター、ベベです。彼女はゴスで、あなたのスタイルにぴったりだと思います。\n\n彼女はいつも口角を下げた悲しげな表情をしていますが、それでも自信に満ちています。\n\nリクエストに応えていただきありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/uJNZzxX", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ko8kyo/works/106", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2344035, "client_id": 817638, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/295fa918/uploads/origins/96322737-5304-4060-b08a-49dfd9e730d8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=76fd47b9cdf4beb86270405f8b80e7d1", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/295fa918/uploads/origins/96322737-5304-4060-b08a-49dfd9e730d8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4a14137b399aeee08fbe5ece3e762f60", "src_set": ""}, "body": "これまでの仕事に感謝する！\n\n今回新たにお願いしたいのは、私のキャラクターの16:9（1920x1080）のアートピースを描いていただけないでしょうか。私のキャラクターは不気味でキュートで、よくドヤ顔をしています。メンヘラのお姉さんタイプ。\n\nこのアートでは、彼女がちょっとクレイジーに見えるようにしたい。ポーズはお任せします。\n\n血のあるバージョンとないバージョンがあればお願いします。\n\nありがとうございます！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ysVZYxSdm_JFpG-K-4yYZ-CHBW6JA372?usp=sharing", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ko8kyo/works/105", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2344035, "client_id": 2787807, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d9900ac7/uploads/origins/12ba8b3c-ef0d-4ff0-86b9-bfdb6b54d30e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fcf4c5dd24d99eee87901f1e55faa94b", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d9900ac7/uploads/origins/12ba8b3c-ef0d-4ff0-86b9-bfdb6b54d30e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=da371784986db7275a441ab2b1ba3d88", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hi Kenyaka, it's nice to meet you!\nI saw your very nice illustration on the sketchbook, and the world view and the design were just right for me, so I would like to request your help!\n\nI would like to request your illustration for two people, so if it is too difficult, please feel free to cancel the request.\n\n[Details of your request]\n...Illustration of a woman and a man intertwined\nI will leave the composition and clothing to you.\nIf you have any rough drafts, I would appreciate it if you could include them in the PSD.\n\n[Character Details].\n1st character\nGender ... Female\nHair color, eye color ... blue-purple\nShe is a woman with dead eyes and a constant smile. When she smiles, her mouth is imagined to open vertically and her hair moves according to her emotions. It usually maintains the shape of an angelic ring above her head. Comparatively speaking, the woman is more expressive. She has a disregard for her own and others' lives and does not always know what she is thinking, but there is an innocent side to her face at times.\n\nSecond person.\nGender: male\nHair and eye color...blue-purple\nHe is a man whose face smiles but there is no light in his eyes. He has the talk skills and facial features to sell a Bible to the highest bidder, the image of a man who does not smile with a big mouth but smiles with squinty eyes. He has a disregard for his own and others' lives and does not always know what he is thinking, but only loves and wants to protect his twin sister.\n\n\nThe following URL has a collection of images of character details. They are a pair of somewhat dangerous people who are united as one and bonded by a bond thicker than blood.\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/mobile/folders/17-Sb8AP0i40pcigcUqeNEoPF_1OIXKU1?usp=sharing\n\n[Intended use]\nSNS icons, presentation when explaining character details, viewing\n\nThat is all! If the amount is not enough, please resend the request.\nWe would appreciate your consideration if you have time!", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ko8kyo/works/104", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2344035, "client_id": 2113048, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/15f4a3c4/uploads/origins/24921ae3-1f0a-48d6-aa9a-a2c75059ef4b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=60a6ec28416f90d9b812665002c39cc1", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/15f4a3c4/uploads/origins/24921ae3-1f0a-48d6-aa9a-a2c75059ef4b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b89d6b096a96647307d7524070a35e34", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hi! I really like your art style.\nI would like to request an illustration of my FFXIV character. \n\nReference: https://drive.google.com/file/d/1442TucFOAWEIFAwwRR5eEcMnh_PUT3mx/view?usp=sharing\n\nPlease draw him smoking a cigarette while resting after a tough battle.Feel free to include blood and injuries. The rest of the composition is up to you.\nThank you very much!", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@ko8kyo/works/103", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2344035, "client_id": 1476586, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3f2d02ce/uploads/origins/3eceb1fa-e850-4d9a-97a9-cff83f2c65ad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=242124a6f18535d63d59aa58514deca6", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3f2d02ce/uploads/origins/3eceb1fa-e850-4d9a-97a9-cff83f2c65ad?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=68690e77c71a3e640a1a88d6a6c85480", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello! I'd like to commission you once more to draw my bunny girl \n\nCharacter -  https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1iMnoFTUg-d-DXxfiepd_gkO4AwY_aFKm?usp=sharing\n\nI was unsure what pose to use, so I'm giving you multiple options to choose from!\n\nPose. https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1SHQ2vDjj5R830WP7J6-wuVSOcSgy28F8?usp=sharing\n\nThank you!", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 12, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "おぷーナ", "screen_name": "op_na_ura", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1890421070349611008/8uk3ST_c.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2350122362/1753346915/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 48}, {"id": 38873, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "はぎのひよ🐥🍡", "screen_name": "hagihiyo", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1889296798709346304/rvwJqNjP.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1068746206510178306/1754991133/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_